abstract: >
  Educational and research-oriented NR PUSCH-oriented baseband vertical slice
  with CPU-first correctness paths, optional CUDA candidate kernels, FAPI-like
  control plane, fronthaul/RU emulator, and reproducible benchmark harness.
  Not a claim of 3GPP conformance or carrier-grade status.
